<ProseLayout
  title="Board of Public Affairs"
  description="Historically responsible for water and sewer in the Village of Midvale; role in transition following the 2024 sale of water assets to Aqua Ohio."
  eyebrow="Government"
  intro="A body in transition following the 2024 sale of village water assets to Aqua Ohio."
>
  <p>
    The Board of Public Affairs has historically been responsible for the
    operation of the village's water and sewer utilities. With the 2024 sale
    of water assets to Aqua Ohio (closing in Q1 2025), the Board's role is
    changing.
  </p>

  <ToVerify note="The Board's current responsibilities, membership, and meeting schedule are being clarified following the Aqua Ohio transition." />

  <h2>What we know</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Water service, billing, and infrastructure repairs are now Aqua Ohio's responsibility.</li>
    <li>Storm sewer and drainage on village streets remain village-managed.</li>
    <li>The status of sanitary sewer operations is being clarified.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    For details on the transition, see
    <a href="/resources/utility-transition/">Utility Transition</a>.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
